"She is a birth transmigrator from Earth, reborn in a Hell Hound pup's body."
"She died on Earth when a falling meteor struck, then saw a bright light."
"She carries the memories of Lisha, a lonely rich Earth girl, and of Lisha's rescued puppy."
"The clashing memories of Lisha and of the puppy give her splitting headaches."
"She denies that Lisha is her past self and says she only has Lisha's memories."
"She came in Earth's integration, the latest wave of transmigrators."
"Her human Veilform takes its shape from Lisha, as she remembers her."
"Genzo, Rin Zaoh and Fox know she remembers another life; Genzo knows it was Earth."
"Her secret Verdant codename as a shadow agent is Yamiko, known only to a trusted few."
"The System gave her a glitched reward for killing the Skeleton Lady, another transmigrator."
"The Umarii Oracle calls her \"the nameless one\", the figure most present in her visions."
"The Oracle moves Themiel, who moves Luke, to reach her."
"Genzo warned her the Umarii seize transmigrators as soldiers or else kill them."
